</span></td>
<td id="A0.T2.4.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;">
<span id="A0.T2.4.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:110.4pt;">
